RuriseOS
===========

Getting started
---------------

To get started with Android/RuriseOS, you'll need to get familiar with [Source Control Tools](https://source.android.com/setup/develop).

To initialize your local repository using the RuriseOS trees, use a command like this:
```
repo init -u https://github.com/RuriseOS/android.git -b 16.2 --git-lfs
```
Then to sync up:
```
repo sync -c -j$(nproc --all)
```


Submitting patches
------------------
Patches are always welcome! Please submit your patches via pull request.